  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Macroeconomic Foundation for Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establish a stable and predictable macroeconomic environment that encourages the private sector to make productivity- and growth-enhancing investments. A solid macroeconomic foundation for growth consists of stable fiscal and monetary policies and institutions and the ability of the government to utilize these tools, in concert, to manipulate the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
